    "sections": {
        "description": "VW Modern Kitchen Theme is a clean and structured option for food businesses, chefs, cafés, and culinary bloggers that want a professional online presence. The layout focuses on clear navigation, organized content sections, and responsive design for different screen sizes. It supports image galleries, menu displays, recipe sections, blog posts, and contact information, making it suitable for showcasing services, food collections, or cooking tutorials. The theme includes customizable banners, typography controls, color settings, and widget-ready areas that help users adjust the appearance according to their brand style. Its design approach works well for modern kitchen design websites that require a simple and visually balanced layout. The template also supports social media integration and basic SEO-friendly structure for improved visibility. As a modern kitchen theme, it can be used for restaurant pages, culinary portfolios, or a cooking blog theme focused on recipes and food-related articles. Users looking for a kitchen website template or a recipe theme may find its layout practical for organizing cooking content, menus, and featured dishes in a clear format."
    },
